     $$t_{\text{HIGH}} = t_{\text{SCLH}} + t_{\text{SYNC2}} = 4000\text{ ns} + 125\text{ ns} = 4.125\text{ }\mu\text{s} \ge 4.0\text{ }\mu\text{s}\quad (\text{meets RM0440 Table 358 [STM32G474_RM0440 p.1647]})$$

