   - RM0440 §39.4.9 formula [STM32G474_RM0440 p.1645]:
     $$t_{\text{SCL}} = t_{\text{SYNC1}} + t_{\text{SYNC2}} + [(\text{SCLH} + 1) + (\text{SCLL} + 1)] \times (\text{PRESC} + 1) \times t_{\text{I2CCLK}}$$
     $$t_{\text{SCL}} = (t_{\text{SYNC1}} + t_{\text{SYNC2}}) + [16 + 20] \times 250\text{ ns} = (t_{\text{SYNC1}} + t_{\text{SYNC2}}) + 9.0\text{ }\mu\text{s}$$
